1c:T730,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"科技熊VPN跑路了吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"截至2026年9月27日没有跑路：官网能注册、下单，三档套餐都在售，后台节点状态当天仍在更新，GitHub跑路预警库里也没有它的记录。但付款后不退款，第一次买建议先1元试用、再买月付。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"科技熊官网是哪个？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官方帮助中心写的大陆专用官网是 kjx.club，打不开时换 cdn.kejibear.info；kjxclub.com 在国内也能直接打开。kejibear.cloud、kejibear.network 是海外用的地址，国内解析被污染。kejibear.shop、科技熊vpn.com、kejixionggw.com 都不是科技熊，注册按钮通向其他机场。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"科技熊VPN有优惠码吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"目前没有公开优惠码，网上也没找到能用的。想省钱只能靠长付：年付比月付便宜14%~30%，御玺贵宾年付折合每月69.99元。官方Telegram群偶尔会抽奖送优惠码。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"科技熊怎么用？苹果手机能用吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Windows、macOS、Linux 和安卓可以在官网下载科技熊定制版客户端，登录账号后自动导入订阅，不用手动复制链接。苹果手机要用海外 Apple ID 下载小火箭或 Stash 再导入订阅，官方不提供 Apple 账号。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"科技熊付款选哪个通道？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"支付宝和微信各有两个通道，分别收5%和25%手续费，选5%那个即可，也可以用加密货币。收款方是第三方，账单里看不到科技熊字样；付款后不退款。"}}]}12:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-foreground/85 marker:text-accent","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-7","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"没跑路"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"，截至 2026 年 9 月 27 日正常销售，1 元能试用一天。